<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: While fishing, {0} has caught something special: {1}-->
  <VCEF_CaughtSpecial>钓鱼时，{0} 有 捕获 一些特别的东西：{1}</VCEF_CaughtSpecial>
  <!--EN: Choose catch-->
  <VCEF_ChooseFish>选择渔获</VCEF_ChooseFish>
  <!--EN: Choose prefered fish size to catch from those inhabiting this biome. Smaller fish take less time but are less nutritive, while larger fish take longer and are more nutritive. Medium fish are balanced between the two extremes. There is always a chance to catch some different fish or special items-->
  <VCEF_ChooseFishDesc>选择首选的 鱼 尺寸来捕获居住在该生物群落中的生物。较小的 鱼 需要的时间较短，但营养价值较低，而较大的 鱼 需要的时间较长，但营养价值较高。中等鱼在两个极端之间保持平衡。总是有机会捕获一些不同的鱼或特殊物品</VCEF_ChooseFishDesc>
  <!--EN: Catch Large Fish-->
  <VCEF_ChooseFishLargeLabel>捕获大鱼</VCEF_ChooseFishLargeLabel>
  <!--EN: Catch Medium Fish-->
  <VCEF_ChooseFishMediumLabel>钓中型鱼</VCEF_ChooseFishMediumLabel>
  <!--EN: Catch Small Fish-->
  <VCEF_ChooseFishSmallLabel>捕获小鱼</VCEF_ChooseFishSmallLabel>
  <!--EN: Allow Fishing-->
  <VCEF_CommandAllowFishing>允许钓鱼</VCEF_CommandAllowFishing>
  <!--EN: Allow fishing to take place in this fishing zone-->
  <VCEF_CommandAllowFishingDesc>允许在该捕鱼区进行捕鱼</VCEF_CommandAllowFishingDesc>
  <!--EN: Disable Gill Rot-->
  <VCEF_DisableGillRot>禁用烂鳃</VCEF_DisableGillRot>
  <!--EN: If checked, it will make Gill Rit impossible to happen under any circumstances.-->
  <VCEF_DisableGillRotDesc>如果勾选的话，将使得Gill Rit在任何情况下都不可能发生。</VCEF_DisableGillRotDesc>
  <!--EN: Fish in this zone:-->
  <VCEF_FishesInThisZone>该区域的鱼类：</VCEF_FishesInThisZone>
  <!--EN: Fishing Zone-->
  <VCEF_FishingGrowingZone>钓鱼区</VCEF_FishingGrowingZone>
  <!--EN: Create a zone where your colonists will try to fish-->
  <VCEF_FishingGrowingZoneDesc>创建一个区域，让你的殖民者尝试鱼</VCEF_FishingGrowingZoneDesc>
  <!--EN: Oceanic fishing zone:-->
  <VCEF_IsZoneOceanZone>远洋捕捞区：</VCEF_IsZoneOceanZone>
  <!--EN: No-->
  <VCEF_No>不</VCEF_No>
  <!--EN: No fish to catch in this biome (this could happen with modded biomes, ask the owner to add support! Or perhaps you are in a lifeless biome)-->
  <VCEF_NoFish>在这个生物群落中没有鱼可以捕获（这可能会发生在改装的生物群落中，要求所有者添加支持！或者也许你处于一个没有生命的生物群落中）</VCEF_NoFish>
  <!--EN: Reset all-->
  <VCEF_Reset_Plain>全部重置</VCEF_Reset_Plain>
  <!--EN: This fishing zone is too polluted to fish-->
  <VCEF_TooPolluted>这个捕鱼区污染太严重鱼</VCEF_TooPolluted>
  <!--EN: Move "Fish" work type to the lowest priority (requires game reload)-->
  <VCEF_UseWorktype>将“鱼”工作类型移至最低优先级（需要重新加载游戏）</VCEF_UseWorktype>
  <!--EN: By default, Odyssey puts the Fish work type on the work priority order between Craft and Haul. With this option Fish will be at priority 90, after Research, which was the way this mod worked without Odyssey.-->
  <VCEF_UseWorktypeDesc>默认情况下，Odyssey 将 任何非细长的水生无肢动物。 工作类型置于 Craft 和 Haul 之间的工作优先级顺序上。有了这个选项，在研究之后，鱼的优先级将是 90，这就是这个 mod 在没有奥德赛的情况下工作的方式。</VCEF_UseWorktypeDesc>
  <!--EN: Yes-->
  <VCEF_Yes>是的</VCEF_Yes>
  <!--EN: This zone of size {0} is set to catch fish of size-->
  <VCEF_ZoneSetTo>这个大小为 {0} 的区域设置为捕获 鱼 大小</VCEF_ZoneSetTo>
  <!--EN: This zone is too small (size {0}). Fishing zones need to be at least {1} tiles to be valid (this calculation is made every few seconds: unpause to update).-->
  <VCEF_ZoneTooSmall>该区域太小（大小 {0}）。钓鱼区至少需要 {1} 格才有效（此计算每隔几秒进行一次：取消暂停更新）。</VCEF_ZoneTooSmall>
  <!--EN: Chance for negative outcomes-->
  <VCEF_chanceForNegativeOutcome>出现负面结果的机会</VCEF_chanceForNegativeOutcome>
  <!--EN: By default there is a 2% chance that any fishing will result in a negative outcome.-->
  <VCEF_chanceForNegativeOutcomeTooltip>默认情况下，任何钓鱼都有 2% 的机会导致负面结果。</VCEF_chanceForNegativeOutcomeTooltip>
  <!--EN: Chance to get an special item instead of fish-->
  <VCEF_chanceForSpecials>有机会获得特殊物品而不是鱼</VCEF_chanceForSpecials>
  <!--EN: Chance to get an special item instead of fish. Default is 1% per fishing operation.-->
  <VCEF_chanceForSpecialsTooltip>有机会获得特殊物品而不是鱼。默认值为每次捕捞作业 1%。</VCEF_chanceForSpecialsTooltip>
  <!--EN: Chance to get an special item instead of fish. Default is 1% per fishing operation. Bear in mind in Odyssey there is by default a 5 day timer between "rare" catches, that you can tweak via these options too.-->
  <VCEF_chanceForSpecialsTooltip_Odyssey>有机会获得特殊物品而不是鱼。默认值为每次捕捞作业 1%。请记住，在奥德赛中，默认情况下，“稀有”捕获之间有 5 天的计时器，您也可以通过这些选项进行调整。</VCEF_chanceForSpecialsTooltip_Odyssey>
  <!--EN: Fisher drops fish on the ground instead of hauling to stockpiles-->
  <VCEF_dropFish>费舍尔将 鱼 扔在地上，而不是拖到库存中</VCEF_dropFish>
  <!--EN: Fish amount (in fishing zone) multiplier-->
  <VCEF_fishAmountMultiplier>鱼量（捕鱼区）乘数</VCEF_fishAmountMultiplier>
  <!--EN: Amount of fish that will be present on a fishing zone. This multiplier will be applied to that amount.-->
  <VCEF_fishAmountMultiplierTooltip>钓鱼区中存在的 鱼 数量。该乘数将应用于该金额。</VCEF_fishAmountMultiplierTooltip>
  <!--EN: Fishing Speed multiplier-->
  <VCEF_fishingSpeedMultiplier>钓鱼速度倍增</VCEF_fishingSpeedMultiplier>
  <!--EN: The speed to catch the fish will be scaled by this multiplier.-->
  <VCEF_fishingSpeedMultiplierTooltip>捕获鱼的速度将按此乘数缩放。</VCEF_fishingSpeedMultiplierTooltip>
  <!--EN: Fishing Yield multiplier-->
  <VCEF_fishingYieldMultiplier>Fishing Yield multiplier</VCEF_fishingYieldMultiplier>
  <!--EN: The amount of fish caught will be scaled by this multiplier.-->
  <VCEF_fishingYieldMultiplierTooltip>鱼 捕获 的数量将按此乘数缩放。</VCEF_fishingYieldMultiplierTooltip>
  <!--EN: Max fish population multiplier-->
  <VCEF_maxFishPopulationMultiplier>最大 鱼 人口乘数</VCEF_maxFishPopulationMultiplier>
  <!--EN: In Odyssey, max fish population in a body of water is defined per biome. This multiplier will be applied to that limit.-->
  <VCEF_maxFishPopulationMultiplierTooltip>在《奥德赛》中，水体中的最大 鱼 种群数量是按生物群落定义的。该乘数将应用于该限制。</VCEF_maxFishPopulationMultiplierTooltip>
  <!--EN: Maximum map temperature for reduced fish yield-->
  <VCEF_maxMapTempForLowFish>降低 鱼 产量的最高地图温度</VCEF_maxMapTempForLowFish>
  <!--EN: Maximum map temperature for reduced fish yield. Above this temperature fish yield will be greatly reduced. Default is 50ºC.-->
  <VCEF_maxMapTempForLowFishTooltip>降低鱼产量的最高地图温度。高于这个温度鱼产量将会大大降低。默认值为 50°C。</VCEF_maxMapTempForLowFishTooltip>
  <!--EN: Minimum days between rare catches-->
  <VCEF_minDaysBetweenRareCatches>罕见捕获之间的最短天数</VCEF_minDaysBetweenRareCatches>
  <!--EN: By default in Odyssey "rare" catches can only happen when 5 days have passed since the last "rare" catch. You can change that minimum interval here.-->
  <VCEF_minDaysBetweenRareCatchesTooltip>默认情况下，在《奥德赛》中，“稀有”渔获仅在上次“稀有”渔获后 5 天后才会发生。您可以在此处更改该最小间隔。</VCEF_minDaysBetweenRareCatchesTooltip>
  <!--EN: Minimum map temperature for reduced fish yield-->
  <VCEF_minMapTempForLowFish>降低 鱼 产量的最低地图温度</VCEF_minMapTempForLowFish>
  <!--EN: Minimum map temperature for reduced fish yield. Below this temperature fish yield will be greatly reduced. Default is 0ºC.-->
  <VCEF_minMapTempForLowFishTooltip>降低鱼产量的最低地图温度。低于这个温度鱼产量会大大降低。默认值为 0°C。</VCEF_minMapTempForLowFishTooltip>
  <!--EN: Minimum Fishing Zone size-->
  <VCEF_minimumZoneSize>最小钓鱼区尺寸</VCEF_minimumZoneSize>
  <!--EN: Minimum Fishing Zone size, default is 25 tiles-->
  <VCEF_minimumZoneSizeTooltip>最小钓鱼区大小，默认为 25 格</VCEF_minimumZoneSizeTooltip>
  <!--EN: Base Fishing Duration in ticks-->
  <VCEF_smallFishDurationFactor>基础钓鱼持续时间（以蜱为单位）</VCEF_smallFishDurationFactor>
  <!--EN: Base Fishing Duration in ticks. Default is 4500 for small fish. Medium fish take double this time, while large fish take three times as much. Decreasing this increases food yield per day, and viceversa.-->
  <VCEF_smallFishDurationFactorTooltip>基础钓鱼持续时间（以蜱为单位）。小 任何非细长的水生无肢动物。 的默认值为 4500。中型鱼这次需要两倍，而大鱼则需要三倍。减少这一点会增加每天的粮食产量，反之亦然。</VCEF_smallFishDurationFactorTooltip>
</LanguageData>
